Three months after release, 2,100 companies:
— Opened the report builder at least once — 34%;
— Created at least one report — 11%;
— Created a second report — 4.2%;
— Ran a saved report more than once — 3.1%.

Inside the report builder, sessions without saving (n = 4 800):
— Median time — 3 minutes 40 seconds;
— 71% added at least two fields;
— 44% reached preview;
— Of those reaching preview, 68% left without saving.

The 25 companies with the highest number of saved reports are retail chains with 40+ stores; they also have a higher average order value.
